5/title_i18n/kr","에이론"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","今晚，要去看焰火吗？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/kr","오늘 밤, 폭죽을 보러 갈 건가요?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415582.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415582.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","埃隆"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/kr","에이론"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","新生的树该怎么照顾呢。"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/kr","새로 자라난 나무는 어떻게 돌보면 좋을까요?"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415671.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415671.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","因度厄 & 埃隆"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/kr","인듀어 & 에이론"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，我们三个真是难得聚在一起。"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/kr","그러고 보니 우리 세 사람 정말 오랜만에 모였네."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn2/herohub_story/10412110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 埃隆 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/kr","라이카 & 에이론 & 패리사"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","卡夫拉，你的剑术十分了得。"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/kr","카프라, 네 검술 솜씨는 정말 대단해."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412120.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn2/herohub_story/10412120.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","埃隆 & 卡夫拉 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/kr","에이론 & 카프라 & 해미"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","诸位，你们有没有觉得月影乡的人对外面有一些……奇怪的认知？"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/kr","다들 달빛 그림자 사람들의 외지인에 대한 인식이... 조금 이상한 거 같지 않았어?"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413080.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn2/herohub_story/10413080.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","埃隆 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/kr","에이론 & 라이카"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","哎呀，麻烦事终于结束了。你们听，这一路东奔西走，连喝水的时间都没有，我嗓音都沙哑了……"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/kr","휴, 귀찮은 일이 드디어 다 끝났네요. 이것 봐, 이리저리 뛰어다니느라 물을 마실 시간도 없어서 목까지 다 쉬었어요..."],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413090.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn2/herohub_story/10413090.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 埃隆"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/kr","로잔 & 에이론"]]}